%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dw-core-functions-log (関数ページ)
doc と相違 (doc の Output と実 DW の出力の値が一致しない)
doc の Output:
  "WARNING - Houston, we have a problem"
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/json
---
log("WARNING", "Houston, we have a problem")
%%% output application/json
"Houston, we have a problem"
